      &lt;td style='width: 184px; height: 90px; font-weight: bold;' align='undefined' valign='undefined'&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td colspan='3' rowspan='1' style='height: 90px; width: 291px;' align='undefined' valign='undefined'&gt;According to the Japan Meteorological Agency, northeastern Japan has been hit with back to back Earthquakes over the past two days. An earthquake with a magnitude of 6.8 slammed through northeastern Japan Thursday morning, and the previous day a 7.3 magnitude Earthquake rocked the same region.&#xD;
